OL,3,AWoman says she 'closed eyes and tried
OL,4,Anot to be there' during alleged Russell
OL,5,ABrand rape
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand, 51, faces seven charges in the
OL,8,Ftrial - three counts of rape, three
OL,9,Fcharges of sexual assault and one of
OL,10,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
