OL,3,AAlberta heads to polls to decide
OL,4,Awhether to hold vote on separation from
OL,5,ACanada
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in the province of Alberta head
OL,8,Fto the polls on Monday to decide
OL,9,Fwhether to hold a referendum at a later
OL,10,Fdate on separating from Canada.
OL,12,FThe vote was called earlier this year
OL,13,Fby the leader of the province, Danielle
OL,14,FSmith, after a grassroots group
OL,15,Fgathered about 300,000 signatures on a
OL,16,Fpetition that asked for a binding
OL,17,Freferendum on separation.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
